    "category": "Dynamic Programming",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given a text string and a pattern containing the wildcard characters '?' and '*', determine whether the pattern matches the entire text. The character '?' matches any single character, while '*' matches any sequence of characters (including an empty sequence).",
